    "details": "<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>HackO'Ween is an inter-college hackathon hosted in Sonipat, Haryana, organized by ALTA School of Technology NCR in caps.</li>\n<li>The event is powered by Alta School of Technology.</li>\n<li>It is a <strong>12-hour innovation sprint</strong>, where participants collaborate in teams to transform ideas into functional AI-powered prototypes under expert mentorship.</li>\n<li>The hackathon encourages participants to combine technology, creativity, and entrepreneurship to build impactful solutions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hackathon Themes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI After Dark: Agentic AI &ndash; Development of intelligent systems, automation tools, and next-generation AI-based products.</li>\n<li>SDG and Social Impact &ndash; Projects must align with at least one of the 17 United Nations Sustainable Development Goals.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Participate:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prize pool worth more than ₹15,000.</li>\n<li>Access to expert mentorship during the hackathon.</li>\n<li>Opportunity to collaborate with innovators from across Delhi-Ncr.</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience in developing real-world technology solutions.</li>\n<li>Swags and goodies for participants.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants may compete individually or in teams of 2 to 4 members.</li>\n<li>The hackathon is open to participants from across India.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes And Perks:<br /></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prize pool worth more than ₹15,000.</li>\n<li>Certificates for all participants.</li>\n<li>Networking opportunities with industry mentors.</li>\n<li>Practical experience in building scalable solutions</li>\n</ul>",
